{"id":"a6c5654857edae16","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md","title":"实 Schwartz 空间的复化及复偏导","display":"df-complex-schwartz-data — 实 Schwartz 空间的复化及复偏导","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-complex-schwartz-data","aliases":["58-df-complex-schwartz-data"],"display":"df-complex-schwartz-data — 实 Schwartz 空间的复化及复偏导","depends_on":["[[58-df-schwartz-space.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]]","[[58-df-differential-operator.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-complex-schwartz-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-complex-schwartz-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-complex-schwartz-data — 实 Schwartz 空间的复化及复偏导"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fbec6c5b7a044255\" href=\"?note=fbec6c5b7a044255\" title=\"58-df-schwartz-space.md\">58-df-schwartz-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"17de8347f6f91384\" href=\"?note=17de8347f6f91384\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md\">../batch15/58-df-smooth.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76305a7e4d824323\" href=\"?note=76305a7e4d824323\" title=\"58-df-differential-operator.md\">58-df-differential-operator.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> 为开集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\\in\\mathbb C^\\Omega\">\\(f,g\\in\\mathbb C^\\Omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Re}f=\\{\\langle x,\\operatorname{Re}(f(x))\\rangle:x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Re}f=\\{\\langle x,\\operatorname{Re}(f(x))\\rangle:x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Im}f\">\\(\\operatorname{Im}f\\)</span> 同理。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb R}(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb R}(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span> 严格指 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fbec6c5b7a044255\" href=\"?note=fbec6c5b7a044255\" title=\"./58-df-schwartz-space.md\">58-df-schwartz-space.md</a> 原有的实值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(\\mathcal S(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span>；本文件不改变该实值空间。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb C)\">\\(C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexMultiDerivative}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexMultiDerivative}_S\\)</span> 在下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial^\\alpha f\">\\(\\partial^\\alpha f\\)</span> 只在光滑复函数及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\)</span> 上使用，是该关系确定的唯一函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"af+bg=\\{\\langle x,af(x)+bg(x)\\rangle:x\\in\\Omega\\}\">\\(af+bg=\\{\\langle x,af(x)+bg(x)\\rangle:x\\in\\Omega\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x^\\alpha=\\prod_{i\\in n}x(i)^{\\alpha(i)}\">\\(x^\\alpha=\\prod_{i\\in n}x(i)^{\\alpha(i)}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\alpha|=\\sum_{i\\in n}\\alpha(i)\">\\(|\\alpha|=\\sum_{i\\in n}\\alpha(i)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}\">\\(\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76305a7e4d824323\" href=\"?note=76305a7e4d824323\" title=\"58-df-differential-operator.md\">58-df-differential-operator.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}smooth}\\vdash\nC^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb C)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb C^\\Omega:\\operatorname{Re}f,\\operatorname{Im}f\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}smooth}\\vdash\nC^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb C)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb C^\\Omega:\\operatorname{Re}f,\\operatorname{Im}f\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}schwartz}\\vdash\n\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathbb R^n)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n}:\\operatorname{Re}f,\\operatorname{Im}f\\in\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb R}(\\mathbb R^n)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}schwartz}\\vdash\n\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathbb R^n)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n}:\\operatorname{Re}f,\\operatorname{Im}f\\in\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb R}(\\mathbb R^n)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}multi\\text{-}derivative}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ComplexMultiDerivative}_S(g,f,\\Omega,n,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\land f,g\\in\\mathbb C^\\Omega\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S(\\operatorname{Re}g,\\operatorname{Re}f,\\Omega,n,\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S(\\operatorname{Im}g,\\operatorname{Im}f,\\Omega,n,\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}multi\\text{-}derivative}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ComplexMultiDerivative}_S(g,f,\\Omega,n,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\land f,g\\in\\mathbb C^\\Omega\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S(\\operatorname{Re}g,\\operatorname{Re}f,\\Omega,n,\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S(\\operatorname{Im}g,\\operatorname{Im}f,\\Omega,n,\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}value}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nf\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb C)\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\n\\to{}&amp;\\exists!g\\;\\mathrm{ComplexMultiDerivative}_S(g,f,\\Omega,n,\\alpha),\\\\\nf\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb C)\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\n\\to{}&amp;(\\partial^\\alpha f=g\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ComplexMultiDerivative}_S(g,f,\\Omega,n,\\alpha)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}value}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nf\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb C)\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\n\\to{}&amp;\\exists!g\\;\\mathrm{ComplexMultiDerivative}_S(g,f,\\Omega,n,\\alpha),\\\\\nf\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb C)\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\n\\to{}&amp;(\\partial^\\alpha f=g\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ComplexMultiDerivative}_S(g,f,\\Omega,n,\\alpha)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>复化被单独命名；实值 Schwartz 载体没有被复值载体替换。由此复线性分布的测试空间对复标量运算封闭。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-schwartz-space.md","status":